-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party tools used only at build time (not included in the app)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

adblock-rust (https://github.com/brave/adblock-rust)
  License: Mozilla Public License 2.0 (MPL-2.0)
  Use:     scripts/adblock/converter depends on the published crate (pinned in
           scripts/adblock/converter/Cargo.lock) to convert the filter lists.
           Its source is not vendored or modified, and none of it is compiled
           into the app.

The app has no other third-party code: it uses only Apple system frameworks
and has no Swift packages, CocoaPods, or Carthage dependencies.
